DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261203T150000
UID:87844dc63ce675298131db8158f4cfc7@events.in.gov
DESCRIPTION:(Hike) Do you know how you can still see animals in the winter
 ? During this short hike we teach you about tracks\, tree rubbings\, and s
 cat to help you know what animals active in the winter months. Meet at the
  Deer Run Shelter to begin our hike on Trail 9. &nbsp\;
LOCATION:McCormick's Creek State Park\, Deer Run Shelter\, 250 McCormick's
  Creek Park Road\, Spencer\, IN 47460
URL:https://on.in.gov/mccormickscreek
X-SOURCE:McCormick's Creek State Park
END:VEVENT
