UID:5f6d02e1209e6e5775bda88f1b671610@events.in.gov
DESCRIPTION:Come create your own snowy owl out of a pinecone and acorn top
 s at the Nature Center Auditorium. Learn facts about the snowy owl and why
  we see them in Indiana this time of year. &nbsp\;
