BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Owl Pellet Dissection\, McCormick's Creek State Park
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261205T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261205T140000
UID:28a06b9814c956fd1ddb45f40b38ed2b@events.in.gov
DESCRIPTION:(Activity) Come to the Nature Center to learn about what the o
 wl&rsquo\;s have been eating. In this lab\, you will dissect owl&rsquo\;s 
 regurgitated skeletons of their prey and reassemble it to give us clues wh
 at they have been eating. The cost for this program is $4. &nbsp\;
LOCATION:McCormick's Creek State Park\, Nature Center\, 250 McCormick's Cr
 eek Park Road\, Spencer\, IN 47460
URL:https://on.in.gov/mccormickscreek
X-SOURCE:McCormick's Creek State Park
