BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Beaver Dam Building\, McCormick's Creek State Park
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261217T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261217T140000
UID:d5794b03e4fb55164ad7a6b4be10096a@events.in.gov
DESCRIPTION:(Lab) With Indiana&rsquo\;s wetlands diminishing\, we need to 
 protect our humble beaver heroes. Beavers&rsquo\; dams act like a filtrati
 on system to clean pollution and organic debris out of our water! Come to 
 the Nature Center and construct a beaver dam. Will it withhold stream curr
 ents? We will be putting your dam to the test. &nbsp\;
LOCATION:McCormick's Creek State Park\, Nature Center\, 250 McCormick's Cr
 eek Park Road\, Spencer\, IN 47460
URL:https://on.in.gov/mccormickscreek
X-SOURCE:McCormick's Creek State Park
END:VEVENT
