BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Winter Story Walk\, McCormick's Creek State Park
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261231T093000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261231T170000
UID:0b82aecded3215a2a522349a13f1bc84@events.in.gov
DESCRIPTION:Start at the Nature Center for your Story Walk journey on our 
 habitat trail. Hike along this trail to follow the children book story Win
 ter Sleep: A Hibernation Story by Sean Taylor. The story follows a child a
 nd his grandma through a winter landscape. Earth goes to sleep for winter 
 and so do the animals. Learn about hibernating animals. When finishing you
 r hike\, please return to the Nature Center during operation hours to coll
 ect your prize. This hike is attended for families with young children and
  is on an easy\, accessible path. All is welcomed to follow and read the s
 tory. &nbsp\;
LOCATION:McCormick's Creek State Park\, Nature Center\, 250 McCormick's Cr
 eek Park Road\, Spencer\, IN 47460
URL:https://on.in.gov/mccormickscreek
X-SOURCE:McCormick's Creek State Park
END:VEVENT
